  era: "Section 9 \xB7 Sangam Age \xB7 c. 3rd century BCE \u2013 3rd century CE"
  title: Sangam society
  text: 'Sangam poems divide the land into five tinais: hills, forest, farmland, coast and dry land, each with its own way of life and emotions. Warriors, poets, including women such as Avvaiyar, farmers and traders appear, and hero stones honoured those who fell in battle.'
